		{
			description: [
				"The Encased Fan is a versatile machine powered by rotational force. By placing it facing different directions and combining it with elements like lava, water, or fire, you can unlock unique processing effects:"
				""
				"&cLava&r in front = smelting items"
				""
				"&9Water&r in front = washing items"
				""
				"&6Fire&r in front = haunting items (with Soul Fire)"
				""
				"Empty space = pushing entities or items"
				""
				"It’s a key part of many Create automation setups and lets you build fully modular processing stations."
			]
